    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37260" root="كنب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنْتُبٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنَاتِبٌ</span> <i>Short:</i> (K:) or <i>thick,</i> or
<i>coarse, and short:</i> (TA:) or <i>hard and strong:</i>
(see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُنْتثُبٌ</span>:) but the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ث</span> is augmentative, (TA,)
[and therefore the proper art. is <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كنب</span>].

